/target
**/*.orig

# Cargo.lock is COMMITTED (issue #143): release builds run --locked so
# a tag's dependency versions are exactly the committed resolution and
# downstream Flatpak/offline builds can reuse it. The apple-swiftpm
# path filter and the sherpaonnx-live cache key depend on it existing.
# (js/Cargo.lock stays ignored: the wasm32 crate is not part of the
# release pipeline — commit it if that ever changes.)
js/Cargo.lock

# Example output artifacts (generated when running examples locally)
/examples/output/

# Local-only live cloud tests (never commit credentials)
/tests/live_cloud.rs
*.live.env
/run-live-tests.sh
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Language-binding build artifacts
node_modules/
**/bin/
**/obj/

.voicegarden-lexicons/
js/target/
node_modules/
pkg2.nupkg
session-ses_*.md
*.nupkg

# Apple SwiftPM build products
/.build/
